WEBVTT

00:00:10.180 --> 00:00:11.760
Hey, never touch the buttons.

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:23.440
I can use some information. Whoa. For this
price, I'll tell you whatever you want.

00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:26.320
I'm looking for a hut. Clothes for the
night. Thank you.

00:00:28.660 --> 00:00:32.980
Gangsters. War criminals. Long live the
Empire.

00:00:33.820 --> 00:00:36.420
We'll take out every bad guy in your deck
of cards.

00:00:44.180 --> 00:00:46.040
This isn't about revenge.

00:00:50.380 --> 00:00:55.300
It's about preventing another war. Strap

00:00:55.300 --> 00:00:55.460
in.

00:01:01.820 --> 00:01:06.580
He will suffer. And then

00:01:06.580 --> 00:01:08.440
it will be his turn.

00:01:11.720 --> 00:01:14.360
Before going into harm's way, check your
armor.

00:01:16.100 --> 00:01:21.100
The kid will live centuries beyond me. 
I won't always be around to

00:01:21.100 --> 00:01:21.660
protect him.

00:01:25.880 --> 00:01:28.960
Are you scared? You should be.

00:01:31.020 --> 00:01:35.680
Do we run? Or do we fight? 

00:01:35.680 --> 00:01:36.700
I like this kid.

00:01:43.860 --> 00:01:45.180
What are you waiting for?

00:02:01.560 --> 00:02:06.040
Let's save the rest for after dinner. 
